# MENU + step 10 shows SAMPLES on kick.wav, and down onto pad.wav previews it through to the end.
input 935200 press menu
input 936800 press step-10
input 938400 release step-10
input 940000 release menu
input 941600 press down
input 943200 release down
# PLAY at 947,200 starts the pattern, whose bars count from there; it reaches the audio part with
# the next step, at 947,328, which starts step 1's note. The notes, one on each sixteenth and each
# sounding through its 10 s Release, take a voice each until all 32 are busy as the second time
# round ends.
input 947200 press play
input 948800 release play
# Shortly before the chord a hit on pad 12 of T2, T3 and T4 sends pad through each track's slots, so
